+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |  Sort: PROFIT.NATION ASC NULLS LAST, PROFIT.O_YEAR DESC NULLS FIRST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |   Projection: PROFIT.NATION, PROFIT.O_YEAR, sum(PROFIT.AMOUNT) AS SUM_PROFIT                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[PROFIT.NATION, PROFIT.O_YEAR]], aggr=[[sum(PROFIT.AMOUNT)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |       SubqueryAlias: PROFIT                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |         Projection: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.NATION.N_NAME AS NATION, date_part(Utf8("YEAR"), snowflake.TPCH_SF1.ORDERS.O_ORDERDATE) AS O_YEAR, snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_EXTENDEDPRICE * (Int64(1) - snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_DISCOUNT) - snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PARTSUPP.PS_SUPPLYCOST * snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_QUANTITY AS AMOUNT                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |           Inner Join:  Filter: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.SUPPLIER.S_NATIONKEY = snowflake.TPCH_SF1.NATION.N_NATIONKEY                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |             Inner Join:  Filter: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.ORDERS.O_ORDERKEY = snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_ORDERKEY                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |               Inner Join:  Filter: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PARTSUPP.PS_SUPPKEY = snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_SUPPKEY AND snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PARTSUPP.PS_PARTKEY = snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_PARTKEY                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |                 Inner Join:  Filter: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.SUPPLIER.S_SUPPKEY = snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_SUPPKEY AND snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PART.P_PARTKEY = snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_PARTKEY                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |                   Cross Join:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |                     TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PART projection=[P_PARTKEY], full_filters=[snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PART.P_NAME LIKE Utf8("%green%")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |                     TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.SUPPLIER projection=[S_SUPPKEY, S_NATIONKEY]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |                   TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM projection=[L_ORDERKEY, L_PARTKEY, L_SUPPKEY, L_QUANTITY, L_EXTENDEDPRICE, L_DISCOUNT]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |                 TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PARTSUPP projection=[PS_PARTKEY, PS_SUPPKEY, PS_SUPPLYCOST]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |               TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.ORDERS projection=[O_ORDERKEY, O_ORDERDATE]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |             TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.NATION projection=[N_NATIONKEY, N_NAME]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=snowflake compute_context=username=SGREBNOV,account=MAAGZJQ-BIB84773,warehouse=COMPUTE_WH,role=accountadmin base_sql=SELECT "PROFIT"."NATION", "PROFIT"."O_YEAR", sum("PROFIT"."AMOUNT") AS "SUM_PROFIT" FROM (SELECT "NATION"."N_NAME" AS "NATION", date_part('YEAR', "ORDERS"."O_ORDERDATE") AS "O_YEAR", (("LINEITEM"."L_EXTENDEDPRICE" * (1 - "LINEITEM"."L_DISCOUNT")) - ("PARTSUPP"."PS_SUPPLYCOST" * "LINEITEM"."L_QUANTITY")) AS "AMOUNT" FROM "BENCHMARKS"."TPCH_SF1"."PART" INNER JOIN "BENCHMARKS"."TPCH_SF1"."SUPPLIER" ON "PART"."P_NAME" LIKE '%green%' INNER JOIN "BENCHMARKS"."TPCH_SF1"."LINEITEM" ON (("SUPPLIER"."S_SUPPKEY" = "LINEITEM"."L_SUPPKEY") AND ("PART"."P_PARTKEY" = "LINEITEM"."L_PARTKEY")) INNER JOIN "BENCHMARKS"."TPCH_SF1"."PARTSUPP" ON (("PARTSUPP"."PS_SUPPKEY" = "LINEITEM"."L_SUPPKEY") AND ("PARTSUPP"."PS_PARTKEY" = "LINEITEM"."L_PARTKEY")) INNER JOIN "BENCHMARKS"."TPCH_SF1"."ORDERS" ON ("ORDERS"."O_ORDERKEY" = "LINEITEM"."L_ORDERKEY") INNER JOIN "BENCHMARKS"."TPCH_SF1"."NATION" ON ("SUPPLIER"."S_NATIONKEY" = "NATION"."N_NATIONKEY")) AS "PROFIT" GROUP BY "PROFIT"."NATION", "PROFIT"."O_YEAR" ORDER BY "PROFIT"."NATION" ASC NULLS LAST, "PROFIT"."O_YEAR" DESC NULLS FIRST |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
